<title>HONG KONG: Ankor Group 1996 net loss HK$42.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Ankor Group 1996 net loss HK$42.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.5 loss   vs  7.0 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  0.8</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  12.11 gain vs  18.66 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    42.63 loss vs  54.44 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     470.19     vs  585.90</p>
<p>    Company name		 Ankor Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 28 to May 7</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Vehicle distribution and service company Ankor Group distributes Saab cars.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of properties.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs 0.8 H.K. cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
